{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791929280, "covers_from": "2026-10-13T22:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-13T22:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791929340, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-13T22:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 52803, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "公共安全", "content": "晴光市場明定禁行機車，沈團隊拜票卻帶頭「引導護航」機車闖入！為選票踐踏逛街民眾安全，簡直帶頭違法！", "display_name": "中山代表 No.52,803", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T22:08:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 62862, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北大縱走陽明山有很多段，但公車都大排長龍，間隔長也不一定擠得上去…挑戰一次就不想再挑戰第二次了…", "display_name": "北投代表 No.62,862", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T22:08:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44803, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "內科自行車專用橋，應該也讓機車也可以騎，因有些人趕上班，不想還要騎的滿身大汗，還要去淋浴完都要遲到了", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.44,803", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-13T22:08:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35544, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "榮總前面老是塞車，想辦法不要讓那麼多車開進來吧，而不是蓋更多的停車場。", "display_name": "北投代表 No.35,544", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 62862, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.62,862", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 44803, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.44,803", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 35544, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "北投代表 No.35,544", "district": "beitou", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 56593, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtow